# Screenshots the Playwright check suites write with a relative path, so they
# land in whatever directory the runner happened to start in. Anchored to this
# directory on purpose: the real texture assets live under public/ and must
# stay tracked.
/*.png
# ...and the same for suites run from their own directory, which is where the
# runner starts them so the output lands somewhere predictable.
/checks/*.png
